  "description": "*“Did you know that your father is a monster?”* \n\nYoung Kane is an orphan boy who doesn’t have a penny to his name. He has to resort to petty theft just to get some bread to eat. But out of nowhere appears a mysterious man, Shane White, who promises to take him in and become his adoptive father. Together, they go to the remote island where Shane and his other adopted children live. But this whole thing is definitely odd enough to raise Kane’s suspicions… Still, perhaps finally having a family and living on this idyllic island is enough to overcome all that. Even so, Kane can’t help but wonder just who this Shane is and what his actual intentions are…\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
